    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lethal pixels, impossible platforms, and retro nods!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Joe and the Lost Pixels</i> is a brutal 2.5D platformer where you'll die more times than in your worst '80s nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a trap. Every pixel, a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you dare?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joe and the Lost Pixels</strong> is a playable tribute to the greatest classics of the 80s, full of nods to a golden era where every jump could be your last and every level hides dangers behind each pixel. Here, every screen is a trap waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Joe</strong>, a brave (and slightly clumsy) adventurer in search of the mythical <i>lost pixels</i>, which hold the power to restore a world corrupted by digital oblivion. But it won\u2019t be easy: snakes, spikes, vanishing platforms, sea creatures, secret labyrinths, and much more await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry too much\u2014sometimes you\u2019ll be lucky enough to find a weapon or two to defend yourself... just don\u2019t get too confident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, Joe has a classic mission: to rescue the usual princess. You know how this goes...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Classic platforming with modern physics and 3D graphics in a 2.5D perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Varied levels: jungles, temples, underwater caves, pixelated fortresses...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Light puzzles and old-school skill-based challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Full controller and keyboard support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Instant death and quick restarts\u2014just like the good old days</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to save the world from forgotten pixels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist so you don't miss the launch!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lethal pixels, impossible platforms, and retro nods!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Joe and the Lost Pixels</i> is a brutal 2.5D platformer where you'll die more times than in your worst '80s nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is a trap. Every pixel, a threat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Do you dare?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Joe and the Lost Pixels</strong> is a playable tribute to the greatest classics of the 80s, full of nods to a golden era where every jump could be your last and every level hides dangers behind each pixel. Here, every screen is a trap waiting to be discovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Joe</strong>, a brave (and slightly clumsy) adventurer in search of the mythical <i>lost pixels</i>, which hold the power to restore a world corrupted by digital oblivion. But it won\u2019t be easy: snakes, spikes, vanishing platforms, sea creatures, secret labyrinths, and much more await you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry too much\u2014sometimes you\u2019ll be lucky enough to find a weapon or two to defend yourself... just don\u2019t get too confident.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And of course, Joe has a classic mission: to rescue the usual princess. You know how this goes...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Classic platforming with modern physics and 3D graphics in a 2.5D perspective</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Varied levels: jungles, temples, underwater caves, pixelated fortresses...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Light puzzles and old-school skill-based challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Full controller and keyboard support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Instant death and quick restarts\u2014just like the good old days</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to save the world from forgotten pixels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add it to your wishlist so you don't miss the launch!</p>",
